  "sourceTitle": "Homemade Dinner Rolls from Scratch",
  "sourceText": "Homemade Dinner Rolls from Scratch\nBy: Michelle Dudas\nPublished: Monday, December 7, 2015 - 7:35am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 Tbsp. Active dry yeast\n1/2 c. warm water\n1/2 c. milk\n1 large egg\n2 Tbsp. oil\n2 Tbsp. honey\n1 tsp. salt\n3 cups all purpose flour\n1 Tbsp. melted butter\n\nPreparation\n\n1 In a stand mixer fitted with a dough hook add in the warm water and sprinkle the yeast into the bowl. Set aside for 10 minutes until the yeast starts to foam.\n\nAbout\n\nDinner rolls are always a popular favorite, especially fresh and warm from the oven!",
